---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact Us"
  description="Get in touch with AIGPUValue.com - we'd love to hear your feedback, suggestions, or questions about GPU comparisons and AI workloads."
  currentPath="/contact"
>
  <article class="contact-page">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <h1>Contact Us</h1>
      <p class="contact-intro">
        Have questions, suggestions, or found an error in our data? We'd love to hear from you. Choose the best way to reach us below.
      </p>

      <div class="contact-grid">
        <section class="contact-card">
          <div class="contact-card__icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/>
              <path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2>General Inquiries</h2>
          <p>Questions about the site, partnerships, or general feedback.</p>
          <a href="mailto:contact@aigpuvalue.com" class="contact-link">contact@aigpuvalue.com</a>
        </section>

        <section class="contact-card">
          <div class="contact-card__icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 20h9"/>
              <path d="M16.5 3.5a2.12 2.12 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4Z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2>Data Corrections</h2>
          <p>Found incorrect specs, pricing, or benchmark data? Let us know.</p>
          <a href="mailto:data@aigpuvalue.com" class="contact-link">data@aigpuvalue.com</a>
        </section>

        <section class="contact-card">
          <div class="contact-card__icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2>Privacy Concerns</h2>
          <p>Questions about your data or exercising your privacy rights.</p>
          <a href="mailto:privacy@aigpuvalue.com" class="contact-link">privacy@aigpuvalue.com</a>
        </section>

        <section class="contact-card">
          <div class="contact-card__icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
              <path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
              <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2>Press & Media</h2>
          <p>Media inquiries, press requests, or interview opportunities.</p>
          <a href="mailto:press@aigpuvalue.com" class="contact-link">press@aigpuvalue.com</a>
        </section>
      </div>

      <section class="contact-section">
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>How often is pricing data updated?</h3>
          <p>We aim to update pricing data daily from major retailers including Amazon, eBay, Newegg, and B&H Photo. Used market prices are aggregated from recent eBay sold listings.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Where do your benchmark numbers come from?</h3>
          <p>Our AI benchmarks are compiled from reputable sources including Tom's Hardware, Puget Systems, and community benchmarks from r/LocalLLaMA and r/StableDiffusion. We normalize results across different test methodologies for fair comparisons.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>How is the value score calculated?</h3>
          <p>Our value score (0-100) considers SDXL performance (40%), LLM inference speed (30%), VRAM capacity (20%), and power efficiency (10%), normalized against current market prices. See our <a href="/about">About page</a> for more details.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Can I suggest a GPU to add?</h3>
          <p>Absolutely! If you don't see a GPU that should be included, email us at data@aigpuvalue.com with the GPU model and we'll work on adding it.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Do you accept advertising?</h3>
          <p>We currently do not accept display advertising or sponsored placements. Our revenue comes from affiliate commissions, and our recommendations are based solely on performance and value analysis.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="contact-section">
        <h2>Response Times</h2>
        <p>We typically respond to emails within 1-2 business days. For urgent data corrections that affect user purchasing decisions, we prioritize those requests.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .contact-page {
    padding: var(--spacing-8) 0 var(--spacing-16);
  }

  .container--narrow {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .contact-page h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-4);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .contact-intro {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-8);
  }

  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--spacing-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-12);
  }

  .contact-card {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-primary);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--spacing-6);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-card__icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    background: var(--brand-primary);
    color: white;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-4);
  }

  .contact-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-2);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .contact-card p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-4);
  }

  .contact-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--brand-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    word-break: break-all;
  }

  .contact-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .contact-section {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-10);
  }

  .contact-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-6);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    padding-bottom: var(--spacing-3);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-primary);
  }

  .contact-section > p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .faq-item {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-6);
  }

  .faq-item h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-2);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .faq-item p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .faq-item a {
    color: var(--brand-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .faq-item a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
